<ResearchPage title="A 股微盘历史研究" titleEn="A-share micro-cap history" description="A 股微盘参考指数与最小市值股票组合的收益、回撤和数据限制。" snapshotKey="microcap" activeRoute="microcap" kicker="小微盘历史研究" kickerEn="Micro-cap history" introduction="这页先说明当前结论，再展示收益、回撤、成交额和缺失价格审计。你可以先看严格口径，再查看其他处理方式带来的差异。" introductionEn="Review the conclusion first, then compare returns, drawdowns, traded value, and missing-price audits under strict and alternative treatments." boundary="参考指数、自建组合和不同市场样本分开展示。部分历史持仓缺少下一交易日价格，页面会说明缺口范围和处理方式。" boundaryEn="Reference indices, reconstructed portfolios, and other-market samples are shown separately. Missing next-day prices are disclosed with their scope and treatment." evidence="规则重建与数据审计" evidenceEn="Rule reconstruction and data audit" question="按固定规则选出的最小市值股票，长期收益和风险是什么样？数据缺口会改变多少结果？" questionEn="What long-run return and risk does a fixed smallest-cap rule produce, and how much can data gaps change the result?" nextStep="继续补充退市价格和实际交易成本，完善组合能否执行的判断。" nextStepEn="Add delisting prices and implementation costs to complete the executable-portfolio assessment.">
